<title>USA: Perini chosen for Hilton's &quot;Paris&quot; hotel.</title>
<headline>Perini chosen for Hilton's &quot;Paris&quot; hotel.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Perini Corp Wednesday said Hilton Hotels Corp has chosen Perini unit Perini Building Co to construct the new Paris hotel and casino in Las Vegas.</p>
<p>The $750 million hotel and casino will have over 2,900 rooms, a casino, numerous restaurants and meeting space. It will be built to resemble the landscape of the French capital and will include a 50-story replica of the famed Eiffel Tower.</p>
<p>Ground was broken in April and construction is scheduled for completion in Summer 1999.</p>
</text>
